overlap.

legitimacy-04-59
00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.765
Technological deterritorialization | A
cross-border meeting at 3 a.m. | More

legitimacy-04-60
00:03:28.765 --> 00:03:29.950
than the state governs you.

legitimacy-04-61
00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:33.143
Symbolic fragmentation | Three phones,
three “countries” | Grand narratives no

legitimacy-04-62
00:03:33.143 --> 00:03:34.330
longer command shared belief.

legitimacy-04-63
00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:37.780
Risk governance | The color of an access
code | Members become risk data.

legitimacy-04-64
00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:43.793
The disappearance of the Other | A faded
enemy poster | Fear can no longer find

legitimacy-04-65
00:03:43.793 --> 00:03:44.630
its object.

legitimacy-04-66
00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.290
